# Run artifacts. Generated by every sync; not source.
snapshots/
sync_log.jsonl

# The manifest IS meaningful state — it is the baseline change detection compares
# against — but it belongs to a deployment, not to the repository. A manifest
# committed here would describe whichever machine last ran a sync, and the next
# environment would plan against a baseline that was never true for it.
#
# In production the manifest lives with the deployment (CI cache, or a row in the
# knowledge schema). See docs/OPERATIONS_GUIDE.md §Manifest.
manifest.json
